WEBVTT

00:01:58.420 --> 00:02:01.640
and to the websites you and I use

00:02:01.664 --> 00:02:04.266
every single day.

00:02:05.216 --> 00:02:09.031
And today, as she struggles to recover,

00:02:09.055 --> 00:02:13.194
she lives with the fact
that thousands around the world

00:02:13.218 --> 00:02:16.306
continue to watch her abuse.

00:02:17.994 --> 00:02:20.422
I have come to learn
in the last five years

00:02:20.446 --> 00:02:22.963
that this case is far from unique.

00:02:24.119 --> 00:02:27.962
How did we get here as a society?

